OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening around the west coasts with
OL,7,Fshowers, dry and clear further east,
OL,8,Flight winds. Rain affecting the
OL,9,FHebrides and western areas later in
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FQuite a fresh feel to the day
OL,13,Fwith rain spreading across all areas,
OL,14,Fsnow on the higher tops. The Hebrides
OL,15,Fand far west seeing a brighter end to
OL,16,Fthe day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
