OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FStormy
OL,6,Fover the weekend, rain spreading east
OL,7,Fon Saturday, heavy at times
OL,8,Faccompanied by severe gales, turning
OL,9,Fshowery Sunday. Brighter Monday
OL,10,Fmorning with lighter winds, then wet
OL,11,Fand windy later.
